40 535 Td
(to output/validation_failures.csv for full auditability:) Tj
55 515 Td
(- DQ-01 Primary Key Uniqueness: Enforces composite uniqueness on (company_id, year).) Tj
55 500 Td
(- DQ-04 Balance Sheet Balancing: Enforces Total Assets == Total Liabilities + Equity within 1.0% tolerance.) Tj
55 500 Td
(- DQ-05 Operating Margin Cross-Check: Compares reported OPM against computed Operating Profit / Sales.) Tj
55 485 Td
(- DQ-09 Cash Flow Reconciliation: Reconciles CFO + CFI + CFF with reported net change in cash balances.) Tj
55 470 Td
(- DQ-11 Tax Rate Boundary: Identifies unusual effective tax rates falling outside standard 0% to 60% bounds.) Tj
55 455 Td
(- DQ-12 Dividend Payout Cap: Flags extraordinary dividend payout ratios exceeding 200% of PAT.) Tj
