0 0 0 rg
BT
/F1 12 Tf
40 755 Td
(Core Ratio Formulations (30+ Standardized KPIs):) Tj
/F2 9 Tf
40 735 Td
(The engine computes metrics deterministically and stores them in the financial_ratios table:) Tj

55 715 Td
(1. Return on Equity (ROE) = Net Profit / Total Shareholder Equity * 100%) Tj
55 700 Td
(   - Handled: If Equity <= 0, returns None (prevents mathematically misleading positive returns).) Tj

55 680 Td
(2. Return on Capital Employed (ROCE) = EBIT / Capital Employed * 100%) Tj
55 665 Td
(   - Capital Employed = Total Assets - Current Liabilities = Net Worth + Total Borrowings.) Tj

55 645 Td
(3. Debt-to-Equity (D/E) = Total Borrowings / Total Shareholder Equity) Tj
55 630 Td
(   - Special Rule: For Financials & Banks, D/E is excluded from screener penalty checks.) Tj

55 610 Td
(4. Interest Coverage Ratio (ICR) = EBIT / Finance Costs) Tj
55 595 Td
(   - Zero Interest: If Finance Costs == 0, labeled 'Debt Free' with numerical value 999.0.) Tj

55 575 Td
(5. Free Cash Flow (FCF) = Cash Flow from Operations (CFO) - Capital Expenditures (Capex)) Tj
55 560 Td
(6. Operating Cash Flow to PAT = CFO / PAT (Evaluates earnings quality and cash conversion).) Tj

/F1 12 Tf
40 520 Td
(5-Year Compound Annual Growth Rates (CAGR):) Tj
/F2 9 Tf
40 500 Td
(CAGR is computed using the standard multi-period formula: (Ending_Value / Starting_Value)^(1/n) - 1.) Tj
40 485 Td
(Crucial Boundary Handling: When Starting_Value <= 0, the standard power formula is undefined.) Tj
40 470 Td
(The engine flags these cases as 'TURNAROUND' or 'LOSS_MAKING' rather than outputting complex numbers.) Tj
ET

