55 655 Td
(5. Dividend Aristocrats: Consistent dividend payout > 25% for 5 consecutive years, D/E < 1.0.) Tj
55 640 Td
(6. Turnaround Contenders: Previous negative PAT transitioning to 2 consecutive profitable years.) Tj

/F1 12 Tf
40 595 Td
(Peer Ranking & Metric Inversion Logic:) Tj
/F2 9 Tf
40 575 Td
(Peer ranking computes cross-sectional percentiles (0 to 100%) within each of the 11 broad sectors.) Tj
40 560 Td
(To ensure an intuitive score where 100% is always superior, inverted metrics are handled automatically:) Tj

55 540 Td
(- Standard Metrics (ROE, ROCE, Margin, FCF): Higher raw value yields higher percentile rank.) Tj
55 525 Td
(- Inverted Metrics (Debt/Equity, PE, Price/Book): Lower raw value yields higher percentile rank.) Tj
55 510 Td
(  Formula: Inverted Percentile = 100.0 - Standard_Percentile.) Tj
40 480 Td
(Composite Score: A weighted aggregate combining Profitability (40%), Solvency (30%), and Growth (30%).) Tj
