0 0 0 rg
BT
/F1 12 Tf
40 755 Td
(Cash Flow Lifecycle Mapping (Dickinson 2011 Framework):) Tj
/F2 9 Tf
40 735 Td
(Every company-year is deterministically categorized into one of 8 lifecycle stages based on cash signs:) Tj

55 715 Td
(Pattern 1: Introduction  | CFO (-) | CFI (-) | CFF (+) | Heavy initial investment funded by external capital.) Tj
55 700 Td
(Pattern 2: Growth        | CFO (+) | CFI (-) | CFF (+) | Profitable operations expanding capex and borrowing.) Tj
55 685 Td
(Pattern 3: Mature        | CFO (+) | CFI (-) | CFF (-) | Core compounders; high internal cash, paying debt.) Tj
55 670 Td
(Pattern 4: Shakeout 1    | CFO (+) | CFI (-) | CFF (-) | Declining growth; selective asset investments.) Tj
55 655 Td
(Pattern 5: Shakeout 2    | CFO (+) | CFI (+) | CFF (+) | Liquidating assets, raising finance to survive.) Tj
55 640 Td
(Pattern 6: Shakeout 3    | CFO (-) | CFI (-) | CFF (-) | Structural cash burn across all three dimensions.) Tj
55 625 Td
(Pattern 7: Decline       | CFO (-) | CFI (+) | CFF (-) | Core operations failing; liquidating assets to pay debt.) Tj
55 610 Td
(Pattern 8: Distressed    | CFO (-) | CFI (+) | CFF (+) | Deep distress; selling core assets to maintain liquidity.) Tj

/F1 12 Tf
40 565 Td
(Qualitative NLP Intelligence & Sentiment Scoring:) Tj
/F2 9 Tf
40 545 Td
(The NLP engine processes 867 qualitative statements extracted from annual reports and filings:) Tj
55 525 Td
(- Regex Pattern Extraction: Detects quantitative claims (e.g. 'Reduced debt by Rs. 2,500 Cr').) Tj
55 510 Td
(- Confidence Threshold: Enforces confidence score > 60% to eliminate ambiguous or noisy remarks.) Tj
55 495 Td
(- Sentiment Scoring: Evaluates tone across management commentary (Net Positive, Neutral, Negative).) Tj
